-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_2\">\\(\\Gamma_2\\)</span> (binary-function graph-code constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d03aab2a94232c0e\" href=\"?note=d03aab2a94232c0e\" title=\"92-df-tuple-graph-code\">92-df-tuple-graph-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_2(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}),\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(S_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq\n\\Gamma_2(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Sub}}),\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(S_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> : 代入函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>作用于一元数集，所以先全化代入函数，再使用全书统一的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_2\">\\(\\Gamma_2\\)</span>编码其二元输入与输出图</li>\n<li>该编码图递归，因而在含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的系统中可表示</li>\n<li>这是证明对角化函数可表示的基础</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(n, n) = d(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(n, n) = d(n)\\)</span>（对角化函数）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-tuple-graph-code","status":"resolved","id":"d03aab2a94232c0e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 ·